WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.946 --> 00:00:06.708
Let's make your first beat in Krypt Studio. It takes about two minutes.

2
00:00:07.117 --> 00:00:13.108
This is the Channel Rack. Your kit is already loaded: kick, clap, hats, snare, an eight-oh-eight and keys.

3
00:00:13.514 --> 00:00:19.505
Click the steps to program a pattern. Kicks on the beat, claps on two and four, and hats in between.

4
00:00:19.904 --> 00:00:22.598
Hit play, or press space, to hear it loop.

5
00:00:25.632 --> 00:00:29.765
Now switch to Song mode and paint the pattern into the playlist to build your song.

6
00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:41.285
To make it sound finished, open Auto Mix. Pick a style, and Krypt measures your track and sets real mixing and mastering knobs.

7
00:00:42.071 --> 00:00:46.436
Before and after, every change listed, and one undo removes it all.

8
00:00:46.826 --> 00:00:52.538
When you're happy, press Control R to export a WAV or MP3. That's it, you've made a beat.
